  "content": "\n\n<div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8aoMKplv/images/81fcb56d7fc54db831facf5febbdd1e021bb7fcc.gif\" alt=\"锄头动作\" width=\"100%\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540mypunchymod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\" alt=\"TikTok\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"60px\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmodinpunchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"60px\"></a></div><br><br><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><section><p>Punchy! 彻底改变了 Minecraft 中战斗与移动的体验。流畅的动画、手持物理演算与实时调校为每个动作增添了分量感、风格与个性。该模组旨在让一切操作更具生机，同时确保不破坏资源包兼容性。</p></section></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><div><span><span><iframe style=\"width:850px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dvTgIbiwHqc?si=vizVyP9oyUwas2KA\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e0f59a12115269646e828a6f7c65f7139efce1.webp\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"30%\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47c36b807e44592bbfd39206911585e92010abc4.gif\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"100%\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>为了与 Better Combat 插件获得<strong>最佳兼容性</strong>，请使用此资源包：</p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/modded-swords-x-punchy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5b655780b2e2a45f484af6e93f268e0c677357c.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"80px\"></a><br><em>点击查看</em></div></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c571a5ef1176c92ce66a7157c33dd1779420632.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"300px\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><p>不再需要单独的资源包，<br>所有<strong>明确的 Punchy! 兼容特性</strong>均已整合至一个 Modrinth 合集之中。</p><p>该合集会持续更新，并包含官方推荐的兼容资源包。</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.punchymod.com%252f%2523compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1295a4a95570fdd19437f2af3d6edb9ef0cf9cd1_0.webp\" alt=\"Punchy! 兼容合集\" width=\"320\"></a><p><em>点击浏览完整 Modrinth 合集</em></p></div><br><div><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"100%\"></div><br><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2bb0d76282288d92aa6d210cac2db4384ac8f439.png\" alt=\"功能\" width=\"400px\"><section><h3>鸣谢</h3>Godku 提供的鼎力相助。<br>Jaredlll08 提供的 multiloader 模板：<a href=\"https://github.com/jaredlll08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jaredlll08 Github 主页</a><br>Lunggolfs 提供的 Social Connect 图标包：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunggolfs.itch.io%252fsocial-connect-icons-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lunggolfs 站点</a><br>CRV6 提供的宣传片与精彩配乐：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CRV6-Music/featured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CRV6 YouTube 频道</a><br>Craftandoof 提供的炫酷起床动画：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcraftandoof\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craftandoof Modrinth 主页</a><br>themodderg 提供的简洁经典模组图标：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fthemodderg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">themodderg Modrinth 主页</a><br>choccy_milk55 提供的丝滑模组开场动画：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fchoccy_milk55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">choccy_milk55 Modrinth 主页</a></section><br><section><h3>许可证</h3>ARR（保留所有权利）<br>允许您未经许可将此模组加入 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中。<br>禁止重新分发 jar 文件（请勿在其他地方分享该 jar 文件）。</section></div></div>",
